<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila raises o/night borrowing rate to 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Manila raises o/night borrowing rate to 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Thursday it had raised its overnight borrowing rate to 10 percent from the previous 9.9 percent.</p>
<p>The bank kept its overnight lending rate unchanged at 12.65 percent.</p>
<p>The Central Bank overnight rates are used as benchmarks in the interbank call loan rate market.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
